      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Random character batch\n\n1. **Set the run count** (next to **Run**) to how many pictures you want, say 8, and run. Each run picks one of your characters and one of its outfits at random, from Character Select's seed.\n2. **Gallery Info** saves each picture in *Random characters*, in a folder for each character and day, tagged with the character, so the batch arrives sorted in Model Librarian Gallery.\n\nCharacters come from **+ Character** in Model Librarian for Chrome on a booru post, or from Model Librarian Gallery. Turn **random_character** off and click the name to pick one.\n\n**Missing the checkpoint?** Model Librarian shows a notice when the workflow opens: **Workflow → Find all sources → Download** fetches Illustrious XL v2.0 (6.9 GB) from HuggingFace, SHA256-verified.\n"
      ],
      "title": "How to use it",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
